# .NET build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
*.log
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.rsuser
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

# NuGet
packages/
*.nupkg

# Node / PCF
node_modules/
out/
generated/
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/

# Playwright (optional PCF/E2E tooling)
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/
.playwright-cli/

# Dataverse solution artifacts: only the unpacked solution is committed
src/Solutions/**/*.zip

# Secrets and environment configuration: never committed
.env
*.env
secrets.json
appsettings.*.local.json
*.pfx
*.snk
*.publishsettings

# Local agent and tooling state
.claude/settings.local.json
.build-cache/

# VS Code: ignore personal settings, keep what the team shares
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/*.code-snippets

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
~$*
